# Terminal Criticism: "Destroy target creature or planeswalker that's blue or red. You gain 1 life." The Artist's Talent (a red
# Class, an enchantment) is refused: only creatures and planeswalkers are targets, whatever their colour. The legal target,
# Bot2's red Masked Meower, is made indestructible in response by Revitalizing Repast (+1/+1 counter and indestructible until
# end of turn): the spell resolves, the destroy does nothing (CR 702.12b), and Bot1 still gains the life (CR 608.2c: the
# instructions are independent; the one target was still legal). Meower is still there with its counter. (The Island in Bot2's
# graveyard is the discard of its own Artist's Talent, triggered by casting the Repast.)

